1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,814
Imagine finding the perfect old van.

2
00:00:03,994 --> 00:00:07,424
A 1996 Volkswagen T4, in Germany.

3
00:00:07,604 --> 00:00:11,325
Well cared for, full of character, and ready for a new adventure.

4
00:00:11,825 --> 00:00:13,853
You bring it home to Ireland.

5
00:00:14,003 --> 00:00:19,223
Then you picture it: the family, the open road, and a summer drive all the way to Italy.

6
00:00:20,423 --> 00:00:22,608
But the van is thirty years old.

7
00:00:22,668 --> 00:00:24,824
Would you trust it to get you there?

8
00:00:24,884 --> 00:00:26,719
A hose you can't see.

9
00:00:26,779 --> 00:00:28,409
A tired belt.

10
00:00:28,469 --> 00:00:30,734
A connection, slowly corroding.

11
00:00:30,794 --> 00:00:33,953
A cooling system, working hard on a mountain road.

12
00:00:35,153 --> 00:00:36,733
Meet Caretaker.

13
00:00:36,883 --> 00:00:43,719
A companion that gets to know your machine: its history, its condition, what's been looked after, and what still needs checking.

14
00:00:44,319 --> 00:00:46,252
It can listen to the engine.

15
00:00:46,332 --> 00:00:47,997
Look for changes.

16
00:00:48,077 --> 00:00:50,921
Read what the van's own computer can tell it.

17
00:00:51,001 --> 00:00:55,663
And bring together cameras, thermal images, sensors, service records, and you.

18
00:00:56,163 --> 00:00:59,755
When something changes, Caretaker helps you investigate.

19
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:03,513
What it noticed, what it doesn't know yet, and what to check next.

20
00:01:03,633 --> 00:01:05,533
A person inspects it.

21
00:01:05,653 --> 00:01:07,275
The work gets done.

22
00:01:07,395 --> 00:01:09,362
And Caretaker remembers.

23
00:01:10,362 --> 00:01:12,817
You're not setting off with all the answers.

24
00:01:12,967 --> 00:01:15,047
But you know your van better.

25
00:01:15,197 --> 00:01:17,030
You know what's been checked.

26
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,130
And you have help along the way.

27
00:01:19,930 --> 00:01:22,001
And it doesn't stop with vans.

28
00:01:22,251 --> 00:01:28,482
What if the things we love had a caretaker, helping us repair them, look after them, and keep their stories going?

